        <mxCell id="Ln9hwU8skmbYJunsBrMh-1" parent="Ln9hwU8skmbYJunsBrMh-0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BackgroundColor LightApplication\n    BorderColor DarkSlateGray\n}\nskinparam database {\n    BackgroundColor LightYellow\n    BorderColor DarkOrange\n}\nskinparam arrow {\n    Color DarkSlateBlue\n    FontSize 11\n}\n\ntitle DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM (DFD) - LEGAL ASSISTANT SYSTEM\n\n&#39; ====================================================\n&#39; FLOW A: OFFLINE INGESTION PIPELINE\n&#39; ====================================================\npackage \&quot;FLOW A: Offline Ingestion Pipeline (Pre-Processing)\&quot; {\n    node \&quot;Approved Legal Sources\\n(India Code / Acts PDF)\&quot; as Source\n    node \&quot;Provenance Register\&quot; as ProvReg\n    process \&quot;Text Chunking Engine\&quot; as Chunker\n    process \&quot;Embedding Model\\n(text-embedding-004)\&quot; as Embedder\n    database \&quot;SAP HANA Cloud\\n(Vectors, Metadata &amp; Graph)\&quot; as HANA\n    \n    Source --&gt; ProvReg : 1. Raw PDF/HTML Statutory Text\\n+ Jurisdiction Metadata\n    ProvReg --&gt; Chunker : 2. Validated Legal Text\\n+ SHA-256 Provenance Hash\n    Chunker --&gt; Embedder : 3. Legal Text Chunks\\n[Section ID, Clause Text]\n    Embedder --&gt; HANA : 4. High-Dim Vectors (768-d)\\n+ Graph Triplets [Node, Edge, Target]\\n+ Model Version String\n}\n\n&#39; ====================================================\n&#39; FLOW B: LIVE USER REQUEST (KANNADA-ENGLISH SCENARIO)\n&#39; ====================================================\npackage \&quot;FLOW B: Live User Request Process Flow\&quot; {\n    actor \&quot;User (Citizen)\&quot; as User\n    process \&quot;UI Chat Component\&quot; as UI\n    process \&quot;Input Normalizer\\n&amp; Translator\&quot; as Normalizer\n    process \&quot;PAL ML Classifier\\n(SAP HANA)\&quot; as PAL\n    process \&quot;Vector Search Engine\\n(SAP HANA REAL_VECTOR)\&quot; as VectorEngine\n    process \&quot;Graph Traversal Engine\\n(SAP HANA Graph)\&quot; as GraphEngine\n    process \&quot;LLM Synthesis &amp; Template Generator\&quot; as LLM\n    \n    User --&gt; UI : 1. Raw Input: \&quot;landlord deposit wapasi maadtilla, 2 months aaythu\&quot;\n    UI --&gt; Normalizer : 2. Raw Text Payload + Preferred Lang (\&quot;kn-IN\&quot;)\n    Normalizer --&gt; PAL : 3. Normalized English Text:\\n\&quot;Landlord not returning security deposit since 2 months\&quot;\n    PAL --&gt; VectorEngine : 4. { category: \&quot;rent_deposit\&quot;, confidence: 0.62 }\n    \n    VectorEngine --&gt; LLM : 5. Top-K Chunks:\\n[Chunk_102 (Score: 0.89), Chunk_105 (Score: 0.81)]\n    \n    PAL --&gt; GraphEngine : 4b. Category Query: \&quot;rent_deposit\&quot;\n    GraphEngine --&gt; LLM : 5b. Entity Relational Triplets:\\n[Act: Rent Control, Authority: Rent Tribunal, Remedy: Claim Notice]\n    \n    LLM --&gt; UI : 6. Structured Output Payload:\\n{ Explanation, Citations, Draft Notice PDF }\n    UI --&gt; User : 7. Rendered 3-Panel View:\\nPlain Language Guide + Drafted Legal Notice\n}\n@endStyle\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="-JxTxqK2noJwnwGAz5y8-0">
